# apps/gateway/.dockerignore — W9-I
# Applies when the build context is THIS directory (compose
# `build.context: ../../apps/gateway`, or `docker build apps/gateway`).
# The W9-I Dockerfiles build from the REPO ROOT instead
# (`docker build -f apps/gateway/Dockerfile .`) — root-context builds need a
# ROOT-level .dockerignore (tracked in the W9-I report; not owned here).
#
# W9-I ignore set: node_modules, .next, dist, tests, .demo-output, .env*,
# fixtures (+ .git/coverage hygiene). **/ forms cover nested copies.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
tests
**/tests
.demo-output
**/.demo-output
.env*
**/.env*
fixtures
**/fixtures
.git
**/.git
coverage
**/coverage
